        "And at Taberah, and at Massah, and at Kibroth-hattaavah, you provoked the Lord to wrath.",
        "Likewise when the Lord sent you from Kadesh-barnea, saying, “Go up and possess the land which I have given you;” then you rebelled against the commandment of the Lord your God, and you believed Him not, nor listened to His voice.",
        "You have been rebellious against the Lord from the day that I knew you.",
        "Thus I fell down before the Lord forty days and forty nights, as I fell down at the first; because the Lord had said He would destroy you.",
        "I prayed therefore to the Lord, and said, “O Lord God, destroy not Your people and Your inheritance, which You have redeemed through Your greatness, which You have brought forth out of Egypt with a mighty hand.”",
